# The manifests in docs/experiments/*.json carry a sha256 of these records,
# and a digest is over BYTES. A checkout that rewrites line endings -- which
# is what git does on Windows unless told otherwise -- changes the bytes and
# the digest cannot match. It did not match: `make check` went red on the
# Windows UCRT64 runner for all six manifests the moment the digests started
# being verified, 22 September 2026.
#
# So the records are pinned. `-text` disables end-of-line conversion in both
# directions while leaving them diffable, which is what a file whose bytes
# are certified needs.
docs/experiments/*.txt -text
